WEBVTT

00:04:30.183 --> 00:04:33.201
We have the science,
we have the solutions

00:04:33.225 --> 00:04:36.642
and we all are experiencing
climate change.

00:04:37.933 --> 00:04:40.951
We are at a moment parallel to Rio.

00:04:40.975 --> 00:04:43.767
Now is the time to take action.

00:04:44.767 --> 00:04:46.995
(Video) SCS: If you don't know 
how to fix it,

00:04:47.015 --> 00:04:49.860
please stop breaking it.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:55.368
SCS: How do we ensure that this time
we act on our words?

00:04:55.392 --> 00:04:59.576
History has shown us
that in moments of crisis,

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:02.868
society can truly transform.